  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 500 VEHICLE REGISTRATION RULES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 500 VEHICLE REGISTRATION RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nDocument #7972, effective 10-17-03, adopted, repealed, or readopted with amendments and renumbered the rules within Chapter Saf-C 500 except for the formerly numbered Part Saf-C 518, which was not included in Document #7972. Part Saf-C 518 on walking disability plates and placards remained as an existing rule as filed in Document #7069, effective 8-5-99. Part Saf-C 518 was renumbered by the Department of Safety as Part Saf-C 521 due to Document #7972. Document #7972 replaces all prior filings for rules in Chapter Saf-C 500, except for the formerly numbered Part Saf-C 518, now Part Saf-C 521.\n\nThe filings of the Department of Safety affecting Chapter Saf-C 500, from the time it was adopted to replace Chapter Saf-M 500, included the following documents:\n\n#4543, effective 12-14-88\n\n#4751, effective 1-29-90\n\n#4975, effective 11-13-90\n\n#5348, effective 3-10-92\n\n#5926, INTERIM, effective 12-14-94\n\n#6019, effective 4-13-95, EXPIRED 4-13-03 for those rules not amended, repealed, or\n\nsuperseded by later filings\n\n#6119, effective 11-22-95\n\n#6243, effective 5-4-96, which also renumbered, but did not readopt except as noted\n\nbelow, the following sections:\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 508 as Part Saf-C 509;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 509 as Part Saf-C 510;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 510 as Part Saf-C 511;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 511 as Part Saf-C 512;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 512 as Part Saf-C 513;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 513 as Part Saf-C 514;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 514 as Part Saf-C 515;\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 515 as Part Saf-C 516; and\n\nexisting Part Saf-C 516 as Part Saf-C 517.\n\nThe following sections in Part Saf-C 508 and Part Saf-C 509 were readopted\n\nand renumbered by Document #6243:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
}
